        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Disposal, industrial devices, to WEEE treatment
mix process of the two disposal ways - the manual dismantling and the mechanical treatment (in a shredder);
UUID: 75aede4f-36f3-49e0-8e4e-1e284e0c9e17
This dataset represents the statistical mixture of the two different disposal ways for WEEE devices in Switzerland.
Location: data of the situation in Switzerland
Technology: current mix of manual and mechanical treatment in Switzerland
Time period: undefined
Production volume: 82.5 kt total WEEE
Sampling: statistical data 
Extrapolations: none
Uncertainty adjustments: none
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_75aede4f-36f3-49e0-8e4e-1e284e0c9e17.xml</text>
